0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 745 Td (A socket is an application endpoint identified by address family, transport type, IP) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 730 Td (address, and port. A TCP server binds, listens, accepts a client connection, exchanges) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 715 Td (bytes, and closes. A UDP server binds and receives datagrams without accept. TCP is a byte) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 700 Td (stream, so applications define message framing. Port numbers identify services on a host.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 55 679 Td (Operating principles) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 658 Td (Socket Programming and Client-Server Model can be understood by following a communication) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 643 Td (from its source through the relevant interfaces and protocol layers. Each device processes) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 628 Td (only the information needed for its role. Correct operation depends on consistent) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 613 Td (addressing, compatible link settings, correct service configuration, and a return path for) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 598 Td (replies.) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 577 Td (At the link layer, frames carry local delivery information such as source and destination) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 562 Td (MAC addresses. At the network layer, IP addresses and routing decisions identify the path) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 547 Td (between subnets. Transport and application protocols provide the end-to-end service when) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 532 Td (required. A failure at any layer can prevent the expected application behavior.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 55 511 Td (Important terms) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 490 Td (Key terms for this lab include socket programming and client-server model, interface state,) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 475 Td (addressing, forwarding, and verification. Distinguish configuration state from observed) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 460 Td (behavior: a command being accepted does not by itself prove that end-to-end communication) Tj ET
0.08 0.08 0.08 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 55 445 Td (works.) Tj ET
